  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Be a stone / rock / boulder. Do nothing. Just exist.</b><p></p>\n<p>Relax, meditate, and watch the seasons change in the most peaceful simulator ever.</p>\n<p><i>Ever wondered what it’s like to be a rock?</i></p>\n<p>Become an unflinching stone in a serene, ever-changing world. Survive centuries of seasons, weather, and absurdly mundane adventures. Grow moss, collect bird poop, and question your existence – <b>Stone Simulator</b> is the Zen meditation you never knew you needed… or the most boring game ever. You decide!</p>\n<p><b>Stone Simulator</b> is a whimsical, meditative experience where you embrace the thrilling life of <i>a literal rock</i>. Observe the world passively as decades fly by, seasons shift, and nature (or chaos) unfolds around you.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Seasons &amp; Weather</b>: Survive blizzards, summer heatwaves, autumn and spring rains.\n</li><li><b>Time Flies</b>: Watch days, years, and centuries pass\n</li><li><b>Absurd Achievements</b>: Unlock meme-worthy trophies like “<i>Existential Crisis</i>” (do nothing for 3 years) and many other.\n</li><li><b>Zen Mode</b>: Chill with calming ambient sounds and minimalist visuals.\n</li><li><b>Meme Fuel</b>: Perfect for streamers craving irony or players who enjoy “<i>so bad it’s good</i>” humor.\n</li><li><b>Zero Skill Required</b>: Your only job? Exist. (Seriously, you can’t even move.)\n</li></ul>\n",
